Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.62,0:00:10.15,TL,,0,0,0,,各{\fs78}186{\fs68}周
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.15,0:00:12.34,TL,,0,0,0,,格拉芙累计{\fs78}377{\fs68}周排第一
